Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On March 1st, 18 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:08.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki was standing alone at this park as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:11.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a little before 6 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:16.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I headed for the hideout back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think I went to get my gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't remember whether\NI actually found them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I left the hideout and glanced\Ntowards the river bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:28.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I saw Yuuki-san sitting there, facing the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And by the time I took the shortest\Nroute back and passed by the park,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at the blackboard, class.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:49.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}A week from now, Hinazuki Kayo will become the\Nfirst victim in a serial kidnapping and murder case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.41,0:00:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On X-Day.\N{\i1}If I can make sure nothing\Nhappens on March 1st,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and have a birthday party\Nwith Hinazuki the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:01:00.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that will definitely mean\NI've changed the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll erase those crimes from the history books.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:40.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Breakfast will be done in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:46.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:54.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to go out on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:02:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I might visit the science center with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.75,0:03:02.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, I'd've given you some extra\Npocket money if it was a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.27,0:03:03.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's actually a date, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:09.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep.\NYou should invite her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.15,0:03:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We could have some hot pot or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki is coming to the birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the Hinazukis over on 5th?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn, I'm giving her all the answers she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:22.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just be careful when you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and eat.\N'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rise. Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:32.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:34.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't the next Liveman look amazing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:35.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It does!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:36.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's a "falcon"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're like eagles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This Saturday, I'm going to get\NHinazuki out of her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or rather, away from her mother's abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:49.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sen—sei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get this part. Could you explain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ugh, they're so flirty with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you use to be just like them until recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit being stubborn and join them, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Yo"? Are you tryin' to act cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:12.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.13,0:04:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei thinks I'm a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.93,0:04:20.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guys, I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.86,0:04:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't we visit the\Nscience center on Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.47,0:04:33.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki's coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.57,0:04:35.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds goo—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:37.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I gotta do that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't go either, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got\Nsomething important to do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:49.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd love to go, but I'm busy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.11,0:04:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're going with Hinazuki,\Nyou'd be better off without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something happen, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told them I can't hang out on Saturday\N'cause I've got a date with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}"I told them I can't hang out on Saturday\N'cause I've got a date with you."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:10.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I {\i0}did{\i1} say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my mother told me to come straight home on Saturdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to take you somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to her for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:27.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you drop by the staff room for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not. I'm not going to allow\Ntwo kids to go out on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not just going to play.\NWe'll get to learn things!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do that at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:40.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saturday's the day Kayo helps me at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:42.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Helps you? With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.39,0:05:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Releasing your pent-up stress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't see the need to answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you so against her going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:52.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can think of several reasons!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:54.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who do you think will have to\Ntake responsibility if something happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bitch has some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:06.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you get out of taking this gloomy girl out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:09.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that? I just want to save my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:10.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Save?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Save Kayo from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:15.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think you're some knight in shining armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.74,0:06:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really shouldn't have hinted at her abuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you feel, Kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:24.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to go with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get your minds out of the gutter,\Nyou perverted kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:34.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Hinazuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go around calling kids perverted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:43.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:46.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Half of it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our kids are motivated about something,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:53.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so as their parents, shouldn't we help them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think our families are pretty similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:06:59.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drop by for a chat sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get inside, Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-See you on Saturday. It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't intrude, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got off work early and \Njust happened to see you kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good thing I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were following us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I was obviously kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, things should be okay for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl was wearing surprisingly nice clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It shows that her mother is\Nconscious about appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:47.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But after our conversation and looking at her mother, I can make a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's a former TV news reporter for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo's pretty cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're 29 years old! What are you blushing for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd better not give up just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:00.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:05.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Saturday, February 27th.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a clear day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:13.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Looks like Hinazuki's mother has thought\Ntwice about hitting her these past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:17.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.34,0:08:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, I love this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's hardly anyone around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like we snuck in. Exciting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hide whenever I see anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.19,0:08:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, she didn't ask me if I was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a peek into this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:46.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna see the planetarium? It's just about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got my fill of stars the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to run to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Déjà vu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:22.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did come here often,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.05,0:09:24.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but never with Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:29.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for inviting me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:40.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you know I liked this place too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that why I chose this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do aspiring comic artists...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tend to come to places like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember having the same\Nconversation 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I came here by myself and ran into Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:04.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think there's a connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I just repeating the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been trying to change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have I been unwittingly following the same path?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki!\NI'll hold your coat for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've already changed a bunch\Nof things with my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:40.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know that I can change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I mustered up the courage to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:51.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:53.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:53.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:57.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got done early, so I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See? It changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:04.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we interrupting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Hinazuki?\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, Satoru's such a gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:25.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, morning, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:26.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:29.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's Monday, but she's here on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Such a pretty face...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:38.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Did you hear that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru's got guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:41.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna get married?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid! They gotta get engaged first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're starting morning homeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki will be murdered tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:55.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}on March 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The real battle starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters, Hiromi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:05.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll come pick you up tomorrow.\NLet's walk to school together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:09.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:12.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:15.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, then.\NI'll come pick you up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:31.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I left home a bit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:35.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}March 1st, 1988.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The day Hinazuki disappeared 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:41.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But today will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.82,0:12:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:56.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki won't be going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:12:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The circumstances now are \Nquite different from 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:12.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru's got guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:17.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki was targeted because she\Nwas always by herself at that park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:20.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you guys better come tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:22.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:25.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's no longer the case as of a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.85,0:13:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go to the kids' center.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I'm with her today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:36.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to go home early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, hang out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:41.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N{\i1}Everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I win again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:45.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:47.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, maybe not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.03,0:13:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fujinuma. I want to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:20.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll come pick you up tomorrow, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:04.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!\N'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said it as loud as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:15.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that Hinazuki, her mother inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and anybody who might've been\Nlistening nearby got the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:21.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}X-Day is almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.73,0:15:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this really it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why the hell did I come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.59,0:15:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:16:00.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I definitely changed history today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's not even 6 a.m. yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:12.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't sleep a wink after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:20.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just wanted to see Hinazuki as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are free now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:50.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're gonna party at your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:53.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's go shopp—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:55.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru and Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need you to help me with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why today of all days?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:06.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably cause we messed up\Nwhile on duty the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.05,0:17:07.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:09.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, this is heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did they seriously not wait for us?\NThat's ice cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That'll be 5,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:19.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think of it, the bill was\Nexactly 5,000 yen 18 years ago too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was so excited about my birthday\Nthat I used up every penny I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think my mother and I made a ton\Nof sandwiches and ate them by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:46.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru! Hinazuki!\NHappy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You planned all this in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:59.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said they wanted to do this,\Nso I gave 'em a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:03.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that why we had to help after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:06.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we asked Yashiro-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He told us it was Hinazuki's birthday too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we just wanted to surprise you a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:17.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, the cakes? Satoru insisted we get two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.35,0:18:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't finish your present in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were working on something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:28.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:32.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, so that's why she wanted\Nto leave so badly yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:36.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I almost had it done last night, but I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NYou can give it to me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's make sandwiches with\N5,000 yen's worth of ingredients!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:48.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? You used up all the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Making sandwiches in a big group was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.06,0:18:59.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unlike 18 years ago, we finished them all in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's fun having friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki and I got a lot of presents from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of you, too. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You walk Hinazuki home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's c-c-cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I became friends with you and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give you your present tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a promise.{;___;}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:56.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.45,0:20:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:13.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I made it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I changed history!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:27.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The guys were gone by the time I got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With my fatigue from the past\Ntwo days reaching its limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and my mind being freed from all the tension,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,2920)}I instantly collapsed into bed and slept like a log.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn, I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not late, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}S-Safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Kayo's the only one who's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The day after our birthday,\NHinazuki didn't come to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The promise we made at the end...\N{\i1}was never fulfilled.
